sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant UI as HomePage
    participant PH as PlayHistoryService
    participant EN as RecommendationEngine
    participant GM as GenreMetadataService
    participant CTX as PlayContextService
    participant PREFS as SharedPreferences

    Note over UI,PREFS: 冷启动 / 首次进入首页
    PH->>PREFS: init() read play_history_v1
    PH->>PH: version==1? migrateFromV1 (keep history, add defaults)
    UI->>PH: suggest(limit:12)
    PH->>PH: compute cache signature(totalPlays, n, nowHour, entriesVersion)
    alt signature unchanged and cache valid
        PH-->>UI: return cached list
    else need recompute
        PH->>EN: recommend(inputs, config, limit)
        loop each candidate song s
            EN->>GM: tagsFor(s) (filtered conf>=tagConfMin)
            EN->>EN: scoreSong(S,A,G,T,X) with missing-dimension normalization
        end
        EN->>EN: applyDiversityAndExplore(artist cap + MMR + explore slots)
        EN-->>PH: ranked result
        PH->>PH: write cache
        PH-->>UI: return recommendations
    end
    alt list empty
        UI->>UI: hide section (no error)
    end

    Note over UI,PREFS: play a song (record + context + completion)
    UI->>CTX: setSource(kind, tags, keyword)
    UI->>PH: record(song, completionRatio, skipped)
    PH->>CTX: consume() source tags/keyword
    PH->>PH: accumulate count/hourCounts/completionSum/skipCount/srcTags
    PH->>GM: observePlaylistTags / observeSearchKeyword
    GM->>GM: update tagIndex/artistIndex (confidence blend + decay)
    PH->>PREFS: save() v2 JSON with index
    PH->>PH: mark dirty (debounced)

    Note over GM,PREFS: optional periodic dictionary refresh
    GM->>GM: refreshCategoryDictionary(categories)
    GM->>GM: match history (artist,name) -> tagIndex (S2, conf 0.8)
    GM->>PREFS: save()
